      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Quoting process was easy and seamless - withing 15mins of the initial discussion I received a very clear, detailed and easy to understand proposal.When the proposal was agreed to their customer service team helped guide me through the Government Rebate Scheme/Application process.Once the rebate approval was done they were extremely flexible and accommodating for setting the installation date. Proir to the installation date they confirmed multiple time and punctually arrived at the time that was promised.The installation team were professional and courteous and communicated at all times during the installation process. They even cleaned up everything afterwards (including sweeping the garage and removing all the brick dust from drilling etc.).The workmanship was extremely professional - everything was cabled neatly and presented perfectly. (the compliance inspector actually commented how 'schmick' the job was)I know this may sound like a paid review, but honestly I'm just so happy with the whole experience. I am a fussy person who rates the experience just as high as the end result, and when a job is finished it needs to be aesthetically pleasing - it's the finer details that I pay attention to.10 out of 10 to Harry and the Easy Being Green Team - A job well done!",
